sofia --worktree login: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `sofia fork`, `sofia exec`, and `sofia exec fork`
sofia fork --worktree: `sofia fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
sofia fork --worktree --last: `sofia fork --worktree` requires an explicit session ID
sofia exec resume --worktree session: `--worktree` cannot resume an existing session; use `sofia exec fork --worktree`
sofia exec review --worktree: `--worktree` is not supported for code review
sofia resume --worktree session: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `sofia fork`, `sofia exec`, and `sofia exec fork`
sofia archive session --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `sofia fork`, `sofia exec`, and `sofia exec fork`
sofia queue --thread session --message hi --worktree: `--worktree` supports new interactive sessions, `sofia fork`, `sofia exec`, and `sofia exec fork`
